# Back-bend and near-180 degree turn test.
# '|' is an exact U-turn; repeated +/- approach a 180 heading change.
# The continuous frame must survive these without flipping or cracking.
angle 30
step 1.0
width 0.13
branch_scale 0.75
segments 10

axiom A
A -> F + F | F - - - F B
B -> F ^ F | F [ + B ] F
